## Selected native configuration (2026-10-31)

This receipt supersedes the source-default, custom 504-recording, and UI-default
claims above. Production uses the existing native saved setting
`modelLockout.enabled=true`; the native source/UI default remains `false`.
Native values remain `errorCodes=[403,404,429,502,503,504]`, base 120000 ms,
maximum 1800000 ms, 10 exponential steps. HTTP 504 is already included by the
native setting. No request-scoped 504 exception, recorder change, or UI/source
default change is selected. Existing tuple scope, cooldown, expiry, and Auto
filtering remain native.

Historical native settings PATCH/GET and scoped regression receipts above stay
as evidence; this docs-only correction ran no tests. The package remains active
and unarchived pending passive runtime acceptance in `openspec/TODO.md`.

